{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game where you can naturally learn about chopsticks while challenging physics-based puzzles inspired by chopstick handling.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and move food from plate to plate with chopsticks to solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement of chopsticks are accurately based on physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of chopsticks are available in game.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no known correlation between performing well in the game and improving actual chopstick skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688340/extras/2c29fa29f74506f0d4226bcb781895d4.poster.avif?t=1767317595\" width=426 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688340/extras/2c29fa29f74506f0d4226bcb781895d4.webm?t=1767317595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688340/extras/2c29fa29f74506f0d4226bcb781895d4.mp4?t=1767317595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by the game below:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Certificate of Completion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688340/94a876e274553fb73090d0eec08e1c29176f60ac.jpg"},{"name":"The Master of Chopsticks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3688340/8e405a454c8e76400eaaf2b776162afdfdb0ed37.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstati